# Cloudflare static-asset headers (Workers Static Assets on the cf target).
#
# Strategy:
#   - HTML is NOT served from here: the Worker renders it and src/middleware.ts
#     sets its Cache-Control (tiered edge TTL + stale-while-revalidate).
#   - Hashed assets (Astro emits content-hashed filenames under /_astro/):
#     immutable + 1 year. Filename changes when content changes.
#   - Self-hosted fonts (/fonts/*): immutable + 1 year. The files are NOT
#     content-hashed, so replacing a font means giving the file a NEW NAME
#     (and updating global.css + the Base.astro preload) — a same-name swap
#     would sit behind a year-long browser cache.
#   - Public images & static files: 1 day in browser, longer at edge.
#
# Rule semantics (verified live 2026-09-14): Workers Static Assets APPENDS the
# value of EVERY matching rule for the same header — it does not stop at the
# first match like Cloudflare Pages did. A trailing "/*" Cache-Control rule
# therefore leaked "max-age=600" onto every asset (fonts got only that, since
# they had no rule of their own — Lighthouse: "391 KiB, 10m"). Keep exactly one
# Cache-Control rule per path family, and never a Cache-Control catch-all.

# Sitewide noindex while the preview is gated. Remove this block on public launch.
# Part of the three-noindex-flips-together launch checklist in
# docs/seo-strategy-2026-09.md ("The three noindex flips, all on the same
# day"): PUBLIC_NOINDEX=false, robots.txt -> Variant A, and this header block
# removed — all three move together, not before. Do not remove ahead of the
# other two.
/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow, noarchive, nosnippet, noimageindex
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=()
  Content-Security-Policy: base-uri 'self'; object-src 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000

# Astro content-hashed bundles — safe to cache forever.
/_astro/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

# Self-hosted fonts: stable file names, so a replacement MUST be renamed
# (see the strategy note at the top).
/fonts/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

# Public images — change infrequently, rename to bust.
/images/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400, s-maxage=604800

# Favicon & root assets.
/favicon.ico
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400
/favicon.svg
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400

# Search index — refresh roughly with HTML pages.
/search-index.json
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=600, s-maxage=600, stale-while-revalidate=86400

# No Cache-Control catch-all here — see the rule-semantics note at the top.
